    "details": "A vulnerability was identified in JasPer up to 4.2.5. This affects the function `jpc_dec_dump` of the file `src/libjasper/jpc/jpc_dec.c` of the component JPEG2000 File Handler. The manipulation leads to use after free. An attack has to be approached locally. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The patch is named 8308060d3fbc1da10353ac8a95c8ea60eba9c25a. It is recommended to apply a patch to fix this issue.",
